# Just enough to run export.py. Deliberately does NOT pull in requirements.in:
# the export runs on CPU in CI and never touches onnxruntime-gpu or the CUDA
# toolkit, which is ~6 GB of the requirements-dev lock.
#
# Install torch from the CPU index first, then this file:
#   pip install --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu torch
#   pip install -r requirements-export.in
